# KAG: unmapped.json IS tracked on purpose — it is the human review queue for
# metric→column mappings and should show up in PRs.
# Release-note videos are rendered per release and shipped as CI artifacts (not
# committed); releases.json (the index) IS tracked so the app knows what exists.
backend/data/releases/**/*.mp4
# Adaptive UI: per-persona layout prefs are RUNTIME state written by the server
# (layoutPrefsStore), not configuration. Committing it would ship one developer's
# panel widths as everyone's defaults; DEFAULT_PREFS in code is the real default.
backend/data/layoutPrefs.json
# Screenshots captured while verifying a render by hand. Useful in the moment,
# stale the next day — keep them local.
*-proof.png